{"id":"026bcae68c39ac6f","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-degree-reduction-principle.md","title":"Reduction Principle in Degree Intervals","display":"df-degree-reduction-principle — Reduction Principle in Degree Intervals","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-degree-reduction-principle","aliases":["67-df-degree-reduction-principle"],"display":"df-degree-reduction-principle — Reduction Principle in Degree Intervals","depends_on":["[[67-df-degree-structure]]","[[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_chapter":"7","source_label":"reduction principle before Lemma 7.11","source_printed_pages":[100],"source_pdf_pages":[111],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"definition-and-signature-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-degree-reduction-principle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-degree-reduction-principle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-degree-reduction-principle — Reduction Principle in Degree Intervals"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" href=\"?note=4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" title=\"67-thm-interpretability-lattice\">67-thm-interpretability-lattice</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_label","html":"reduction principle before Lemma 7.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>100</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>111</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-and-signature-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_T,\\leq_T,\\mathbf0_T\">\\(D_T,\\leq_T,\\mathbf0_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_T,\\vee_T\">\\(\\wedge_T,\\vee_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" href=\"?note=4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" title=\"67-thm-interpretability-lattice\">67-thm-interpretability-lattice</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_0,a_1\\in D_T\">\\(a_0,a_1\\in D_T\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_0\\leq_Ta_1\">\\(a_0\\leq_Ta_1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_T(a_0,a_1)\">\\(I_T(a_0,a_1)\\)</span> 为下式构造的闭区间载体。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RP}_T(a_0,a_1)\">\\(\\mathrm{RP}_T(a_0,a_1)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RPDeg}_T(a)\">\\(\\mathrm{RPDeg}_T(a)\\)</span> 分别是区间和度的一阶元语言谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in D_T\">\\(a\\in D_T\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_T(a_0,a_1)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in D_T:a_0\\leq_Tx\\land x\\leq_Ta_1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_T(a_0,a_1)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in D_T:a_0\\leq_Tx\\land x\\leq_Ta_1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RP}_T(a_0,a_1)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall b_0,b_1\\in I_T(a_0,a_1)\\;\\bigl(b_0\\vee_Tb_1=a_1\\to{}\\\\\n\\exists c_0,c_1\\in I_T(a_0,a_1)\\;(c_0\\leq_Tb_0\\land c_1\\leq_Tb_1\\land c_0\\wedge_Tc_1=a_0\\land c_0\\vee_Tc_1=a_1)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RP}_T(a_0,a_1)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall b_0,b_1\\in I_T(a_0,a_1)\\;\\bigl(b_0\\vee_Tb_1=a_1\\to{}\\\\\n\\exists c_0,c_1\\in I_T(a_0,a_1)\\;(c_0\\leq_Tb_0\\land c_1\\leq_Tb_1\\land c_0\\wedge_Tc_1=a_0\\land c_0\\vee_Tc_1=a_1)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RPDeg}_T(a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{RP}_T(\\mathbf0_T,a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RPDeg}_T(a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{RP}_T(\\mathbf0_T,a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷100页/PDF111页用约化原理区分度区间。约化得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_i\">\\(c_i\\)</span> 必须留在原闭区间内，且仅要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_i\\leq b_i\">\\(c_i\\leq b_i\\)</span>，不能误加强为严格不等式。源定义先讨论非退化区间；此处同一公式也用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_0=a_1\">\\(a_0=a_1\\)</span>，这时由单点见证自动成立，是明确的局部延拓。</p>\n<p>本簇已存在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4c508de82eee13d8\" href=\"?note=4c508de82eee13d8\" title=\"67-thm-degree-interval-nonduality\">67-thm-degree-interval-nonduality</a> 的同名局部闭区间记号，其集合构造完全一致，本节点将其作为可复用定义固定下来；不另造不同语义的区间。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-interpretability-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"4ff6c9f71377d6d7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D_T,\\leq_T,\\mathbf0_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$\\wedge_T,\\vee_T$ 采用 [[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-interpretability-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"4ff6c9f71377d6d7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D_T,\\leq_T,\\mathbf0_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$\\wedge_T,\\vee_T$ 采用 [[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-degree-interval-nonduality","status":"resolved","id":"4c508de82eee13d8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本簇已存在 [[67-thm-degree-interval-nonduality]] 的同名局部闭区间记号，其集合构造完全一致，本节点将其作为可复用定义固定下来；不另造不同语义的区间。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D_T,\\leq_T,\\mathbf0_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge_T,\\vee_T","display":false},{"tex":"a_0,a_1\\in D_T","display":false},{"tex":"a_0\\leq_Ta_1","display":false},{"tex":"I_T(a_0,a_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RP}_T(a_0,a_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RPDeg}_T(a)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in D_T","display":false},{"tex":"I_T(a_0,a_1)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in D_T:a_0\\leq_Tx\\land x\\leq_Ta_1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RP}_T(a_0,a_1)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall b_0,b_1\\in I_T(a_0,a_1)\\;\\bigl(b_0\\vee_Tb_1=a_1\\to{}\\\\\n\\exists c_0,c_1\\in I_T(a_0,a_1)\\;(c_0\\leq_Tb_0\\land c_1\\leq_Tb_1\\land c_0\\wedge_Tc_1=a_0\\land c_0\\vee_Tc_1=a_1)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RPDeg}_T(a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{RP}_T(\\mathbf0_T,a).","display":true},{"tex":"c_i","display":false},{"tex":"c_i\\leq b_i","display":false},{"tex":"a_0=a_1","display":false}],"bytes":2243,"backlinks":[{"id":"4c508de82eee13d8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"闭区间载体 $I_T(a,b)$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-reduction-principle]] 的同一构造，适用范围为 $a,b\\in D_T$ 且 $a\\leq_Tb$；关系逆 $\\leq_T^{-1}=\\{(y,x):(x,y)\\in\\leq_T\\}$；$\\mathrm{Iso}$ 是四元谓词。"},{"id":"ecb1675a32137cec","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf P_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-complexity]]；$\\mathrm{RPDeg}_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-reduction-principle]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-degree-reduction-principle]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-degree-reduction-principle]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]；[[../67-thm-degree-splitting-density]]；[[../67-df-degree-complexity]]；[[../67-thm-degree-delta2]]；[[../67-df-degree-pseudocomplement]]；[[../67-df-degree-cupping-capping]]；[[../67-df-degree-high-low]]；[[../67-df-degree-reduction-principle]]；[[../67-thm-degree-infinitary-distributivity]]；[[../67-thm-degree-finite-generation-gap]]"}],"outgoing":["f5b9611e728efd8b","4ff6c9f71377d6d7","4c508de82eee13d8"]}